  },
  "response_to_critic": "Addressed the main issue raised by both CommonSenseAgent and ValidatorAgent: reduced find_acacia_door max_distance from 16 to 5. This ensures the player must actually walk to the door (~8-10 blocks from spawn) rather than satisfying the milestone from near spawn. The find_potted_red_tulip milestone (max_distance=5) and mine_carrots milestone (inventory_has carrot, min_count=1) were both validated as correct and remain unchanged. The /gamemode survival @s command was confirmed included in the scene commands by SceneDesignerAgent.",
  "scene_clarification_request": "None — all spatial coordinates have been confirmed through multiple sandbox previews. The scene design is finalized."
}
```

### Summary of Changes
| Milestone | Change | Reason |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| find_acacia_door | max_distance: 16 → **5** | Both CommonSenseAgent and ValidatorAgent flagged that 16 was too generous since the door is only ~10 blocks from spawn |
| find_potted_red_tulip | No change | Already validated as correct (max_distance=5 requires being inside the house) |
| mine_carrots | No change | Already validated as correct (inventory_has carrot, min_count=1) |
